# This repository tracks the Lewis Hamilton site only.
#
# Deny-by-default, then allow app/. Everything else in this working directory —
# the reference material it was studied against, the planning docs, the tooling
# used to produce them — stays local.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/app/

# Inside app/
app/node_modules/
app/dist/
app/*.log
app/*.err
app/.vite/

# Third-party binaries that must not be redistributed from this repo.
#
# The hero currently loads the reference site's own helmet model as a local
# stand-in so the scene can be built and tuned against something real. It is not
# our artwork, and pushing it would make a public repo republish it. The code
# that loads it is tracked; the file is not — so a fresh clone renders the hero
# without a helmet and logs why, rather than shipping someone else's asset.
# Replace with an original model, then delete this rule.
app/public/assets/helmet/*.glb
app/public/assets/helmet/*.gltf
app/public/assets/helmet/*.bin

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
